Do not hand-edit these. Regenerate them with the tool that owns them.

- **`healthcare/public/frontend/assets/*`** (hashed `patient_portal-*.js`, `.js.map`, `.css`) and `healthcare/public/frontend/index.html` and `manifest.json`: built output of the Vue patient portal. They are committed. Rebuild with `yarn build`. Pre-commit excludes `healthcare/public/frontend/assets/` and `healthcare/public/dist/`.
- **`patient_portal/auto-imports.d.ts`, `patient_portal/components.d.ts`:** generated by the frappe-ui/unplugin Vite plugins.
- **`healthcare/locale/main.pot`:** generated by `.github/helper/update_pot_file.sh`, which runs on a weekly scheduled workflow. The `*.po` translations come from Crowdin via `crowdin.yml`.
- **`yarn.lock`:** Yarn lockfile. Change it only through `yarn`.
- **DocType / Report / Workspace / Print Format `*.json`:** schema metadata that Frappe exports when it is edited in the Desk UI (developer mode). Keep keys and formatting as Frappe writes them, and bump `modified` when you change one.
- **`healthcare/__init__.py` version string:** rewritten by semantic-release (`.releaserc` prepareCmd).
- **`healthcare/public/node_modules`:** a symlink to a local bench path. It is not real source, so never commit changes through it.
- **Ignored:** `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `__pycache__/`, `*.egg-info`, `healthcare/docs/current`.
- **Build-managed mirrors:** `.claude/rules/build-rules.md`, `.cursor/rules/build-rules.mdc` and `.github/instructions/build-rules.instructions.md` mirror `.build/RULES.md`. The marked block in `AGENTS.md` is overwritten by Build.
- **`.secrets.baseline`:** maintained by detect-secrets.
